From ef1cb5dabeaa85627dc0768828a04351b073415d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tshyshko <tshyshko@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 22:08:54 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] ci(release): harden release/publish pipeline (fork audit)

- pin every third-party action to a full commit SHA (tag in comment)
- least-privilege permissions: release.yml top-level {} with per-job grants;
  ci/canary/prod-drift default to contents: read
- release.yml: package job builds sdk/mcp/python from the lockfile, packs twice
  from clean builds and fails on any hash diff, cleans tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
  (stale composite cache packed a dist-less sdk), runs npm publish --dry-run
  and twine check (no registry write), attests build provenance, attaches
  artifacts + SHA256SUMS; '-' tags are pre-releases, never latest
- publish.yml: dry-run forced outside maxfain/basedagents and default for
  dispatch; npm pinned to 11.21.0 instead of npm@latest; pypi action pinned
- ci.yml: production deploy only in maxfain/basedagents
- canary/prod-drift: scheduled runs only in maxfain/basedagents
